.TH QUIPU-GATE-SHADOW 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-gate\-shadow \- Judge a candidate policy set over recorded history on a quiescent copy
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu gate shadow\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-rules\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-from\-tx\fR] [\fB\-\-to\-tx\fR] [\fB\-\-last\-txs\fR] [\fB\-\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-txs\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Judge a candidate policy set over recorded history on a quiescent copy
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-rules\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Rule set to load or evaluate
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Starting share or transaction for incremental output
.TP
\fB\-\-from\-tx\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
First transaction in the selected interval
.TP
\fB\-\-to\-tx\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Last transaction in the selected interval
.TP
\fB\-\-last\-txs\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Number of recent transactions to evaluate
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Operation mode
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-txs\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Maximum transactions to evaluate
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
